            <ArticleTitle>Analgesic utilization patterns in a hospice.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>33-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Many terminally ill cancer patients suffer from unnecessary pain as a result of inadequate pain management. This study analyzes analgesics and other drugs used in a hospice setting over a five-year period to control pain and improve patient care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
